WEBVTT

00:00:00.010 --> 00:00:02.020
Poverty Shopping District

00:00:06.290 --> 00:00:09.480
<i>It's been a long time. Have you all been well?</i>

00:00:07.980 --> 00:00:09.080
Welcome!

00:00:09.080 --> 00:00:10.220
What'll it be?

00:00:11.690 --> 00:00:13.950
Let's see... I'll take one of these.

00:00:11.690 --> 00:00:13.950
<i>And for those of you watching for the first time,</i>

00:00:15.330 --> 00:00:18.700
<i>my name is Hayate Ayasaki, 
and I'm 16 years old.</i>

00:00:16.470 --> 00:00:18.690
<b>Hayate Ayasaki</b>

00:00:18.700 --> 00:00:19.660
Here you go. Thank you.

00:00:26.310 --> 00:00:29.380
<i>After my parents forced a debt 
of 150 million yen onto me,</i>

00:00:29.380 --> 00:00:32.070
<i>my life was very close to a dead end,</i>

00:00:32.070 --> 00:00:33.760
<i>but one way or another,</i>

00:00:34.490 --> 00:00:37.370
<i>I'm now Miss Nagi Sanzenin's butler.</i>

00:00:37.770 --> 00:00:38.690
<i>My talent is...</i>

00:00:39.830 --> 00:00:42.020
<b>Misfortune</b>

00:00:41.150 --> 00:00:42.020
Misfortune.

00:02:11.940 --> 00:02:17.400
<b>Room Available</b>

00:02:11.940 --> 00:02:17.400
<b>Butler Included</b>

00:02:19.860 --> 00:02:23.030
<b>On Duty Today</b>

00:02:19.860 --> 00:02:23.030
<b>Klaus         Hayate</b>

00:02:25.710 --> 00:02:27.790
Sure is a nice morning.

00:02:42.080 --> 00:02:44.370
Good morning, Hinagiku-san.

00:02:44.370 --> 00:02:45.930
Morning, Hayate-kun.

00:02:46.450 --> 00:02:48.730
Hard at work early as always, I see.

00:02:49.350 --> 00:02:51.040
Getting ready for a run again today?

00:02:51.430 --> 00:02:52.230
Yeah.

00:02:52.630 --> 00:02:55.670
I just can't get started 
if I don't run for about an hour.

00:02:56.680 --> 00:02:57.870
Good luck.

00:02:58.870 --> 00:03:02.240
I'll make some honey preserved lemons 
and wait for your return.

00:03:02.690 --> 00:03:05.000
Uh... Thanks.

00:03:12.660 --> 00:03:18.050
It's unusual to see you looking so 
tired in the morning, Maria-san.

00:03:18.630 --> 00:03:23.870
Nagi is in much more energetic here 
than when we're in the mansion.

00:03:23.870 --> 00:03:25.720
It's so hard to get her to sleep.

00:03:26.950 --> 00:03:28.550
Just like a kitten.

00:03:29.120 --> 00:03:30.650
She certainly is a handful.

00:03:31.130 --> 00:03:31.980
Well...

00:03:32.870 --> 00:03:34.230
Would you like some of these?

00:03:35.110 --> 00:03:35.980
Oh my...

00:03:35.980 --> 00:03:37.690
What are these for?

00:03:37.960 --> 00:03:41.570
Relieving everyone's exhaustion 
is another part of a butler's job.

00:03:42.230 --> 00:03:43.200
I'm back.

00:03:43.200 --> 00:03:45.860
Hayate-kun, is it okay if I use the bath?

00:03:46.210 --> 00:03:47.880
I've already filled it with hot water.

00:03:48.400 --> 00:03:49.870
And these are ready as well.

00:03:49.870 --> 00:03:52.080
Wow, thanks!

00:03:52.080 --> 00:03:54.250
Okay, I'm going to grab a quick bath.

00:03:58.010 --> 00:04:01.430
<i>Hayate-kun certainly is the
 type who's popular with girls</i>

00:04:03.190 --> 00:04:05.680
Please wake up, Miss!

00:04:06.120 --> 00:04:09.260
Like I'm gonna let you 
wake me up that way!

00:04:10.010 --> 00:04:11.640
You'll be late.

00:04:15.470 --> 00:04:18.050
Good morning, Chiharu-san.

00:04:18.580 --> 00:04:20.820
What would you like for breakfast?

00:04:21.880 --> 00:04:24.070
Then... I'll have bread and salad.

00:04:24.500 --> 00:04:27.010
Certainly. 
I'll have it ready right away.

00:04:29.290 --> 00:04:32.080
Life with a butler is crazy.

00:04:36.420 --> 00:04:40.320
By the way, shouldn't your 
mistress be awake by now?

00:04:40.590 --> 00:04:41.670
Well...

00:04:42.310 --> 00:04:45.260
I've been trying to wake 
her for some time now,

00:04:45.790 --> 00:04:48.770
but she remains stubbornly 
confined within her futon...

00:04:48.770 --> 00:04:50.920
Crap, I overslept!

00:04:50.920 --> 00:04:54.260
Life with a butler is crazy.

00:04:56.150 --> 00:04:58.150
Do you all have your lunches?

00:04:58.470 --> 00:04:59.250
Yeah.

00:04:59.250 --> 00:05:01.870
Nishizawa-san, I made sure to include

00:05:01.870 --> 00:05:03.790
the rolled omelet you asked for.

00:05:03.790 --> 00:05:06.160
Yay! Thanks, Hayate-kun!

00:05:06.430 --> 00:05:07.130
Bye then.

00:05:07.130 --> 00:05:08.590
See you later!

00:05:08.590 --> 00:05:09.410
Later.

00:05:09.770 --> 00:05:11.040
Take care.

00:05:11.660 --> 00:05:12.330
<b>English Made Easy</b>

00:05:14.840 --> 00:05:16.170
Oh, Hayate-kun.

00:05:16.560 --> 00:05:17.760
Are you studying?

00:05:17.760 --> 00:05:20.340
Final exams start in two days.

00:05:20.720 --> 00:05:22.860
I don't want to fail.

00:05:22.860 --> 00:05:25.680
It must be difficult juggling school
 with being a butler.

00:05:25.680 --> 00:05:29.740
I can't study much when 
everyone is here.

00:05:31.340 --> 00:05:32.480
Nagi still isn't awake?

00:05:32.950 --> 00:05:34.990
She should be up soon.

00:05:35.920 --> 00:05:37.980
It's already 8:30!

00:05:37.980 --> 00:05:41.070
Why didn't you wake me up, Hayate?!

00:05:41.070 --> 00:05:43.010
I did wake you up!

00:05:43.010 --> 00:05:45.810
I was really going to 
try hard starting today!

00:05:45.810 --> 00:05:47.770
Why do I have to be late 
as soon as I start trying?!

00:05:47.770 --> 00:05:48.980
Well then, stop staying up all night

00:05:48.980 --> 00:05:50.560
and wake up properly in the morning!

00:05:50.560 --> 00:05:53.380
If I could do that, 
my life would be easy!

00:05:53.380 --> 00:05:54.540
Nagi, aren't you having breakfast?

00:05:54.540 --> 00:05:56.620
No need! Hurry up, Hayate!

00:05:56.620 --> 00:05:58.420
Y-Yes, Miss!

00:06:15.300 --> 00:06:16.780
I'm back!

00:06:16.780 --> 00:06:18.190
We're back.

00:06:18.540 --> 00:06:20.110
Welcome home, both of you.

00:06:23.270 --> 00:06:25.210
Everyone, it's time for dinner.

00:06:27.650 --> 00:06:29.150
Thanks for dinner!

00:06:29.360 --> 00:06:30.950
Let's play video games!

00:06:31.360 --> 00:06:33.620
After studying and taking a bath.

00:06:33.620 --> 00:06:35.870
<b>Monster Peninsula Portable</b>

00:06:34.160 --> 00:06:35.870
Look! It's the newest one!

00:06:35.870 --> 00:06:38.120
Y-You bought that?!

00:06:38.360 --> 00:06:41.190
What say you? 
You can't beat this temptation!

00:06:41.190 --> 00:06:45.090
You mustn't, Miss. 
We all have exams soon.

00:06:47.540 --> 00:06:48.470
I'm back.

00:06:49.070 --> 00:06:52.220
Welcome home. 
I'll get your dinner ready right away.

00:07:02.110 --> 00:07:04.080
Okay, let's play video games!

00:07:04.080 --> 00:07:06.360
I told you, after I've had a bath.

00:07:06.660 --> 00:07:08.740
The hamster's in there now.

00:07:09.000 --> 00:07:11.240
Long waits were made for gaming!

00:07:12.320 --> 00:07:14.500
Only until my turn in the bath.

00:07:16.060 --> 00:07:16.990
All right!

00:07:21.760 --> 00:07:23.040
Gah, here comes one!

00:07:23.040 --> 00:07:24.960
Quick, Paint! Use Paint!

00:07:24.960 --> 00:07:27.630
What are you doing in 
the changing room?

00:07:28.410 --> 00:07:29.130
Okay...

00:07:29.760 --> 00:07:33.110
I guess I'll stop here 
and go take my bath.

00:07:38.630 --> 00:07:40.690
Hayate-kun, what are you doing?

00:07:41.140 --> 00:07:42.450
Preparations for tomorrow.

00:07:42.910 --> 00:07:46.680
I want to make sure everyone gets 
the most delicious meal possible.

00:07:46.680 --> 00:07:48.000
Sounds like hard work.

00:07:48.880 --> 00:07:50.400
Do you have time to study?

00:07:50.730 --> 00:07:53.880
Once I finish here, 
I plan to work hard until bedtime.

00:07:53.880 --> 00:07:55.950
Oh, that's right...

00:07:57.020 --> 00:07:59.660
I've got these soaking 
for tomorrow, too.

00:07:59.990 --> 00:08:01.550
Look forward to them.

00:08:03.430 --> 00:08:05.090
Thanks, Hayate-kun.

00:08:16.160 --> 00:08:18.240
I'm sorry about this, Hayate-kun.

00:08:18.240 --> 00:08:20.300
Having you carry her all the way 
from Chiharu-san's room...

00:08:20.860 --> 00:08:23.600
Not at all. She is quite light.

00:08:28.080 --> 00:08:30.590
Well, goodnight, Maria-san.

00:08:30.590 --> 00:08:32.520
Goodnight, Hayate-kun.

00:08:35.290 --> 00:08:36.620
<i>This isn't good.</i>

00:08:37.040 --> 00:08:40.120
<i>At the rate I'm going, 
I'll be right on the edge of failing.</i>

00:08:40.460 --> 00:08:43.870
<i>No! I still have another day. 
I'll make it work.</i>

00:08:43.870 --> 00:08:44.550
Hayate-kun?

00:08:44.550 --> 00:08:46.200
Y-Yes, come in.

00:08:47.340 --> 00:08:49.350
Hinagiku-san? What's the matter?

00:08:49.780 --> 00:08:54.840
W-Well, I thought I'd help
 you study, if you'd like.

00:08:54.840 --> 00:08:57.590
What? I couldn't make you do that...

00:08:57.900 --> 00:08:59.660
Call it my thanks for everything.

00:08:59.660 --> 00:09:01.970
It's all I can do, though...

00:09:03.190 --> 00:09:05.360
Thank you. That would be a great help.

00:09:06.390 --> 00:09:08.720
I just happened to come to 
something I don't understand.

00:09:08.720 --> 00:09:10.730
If I may... What is it?

00:09:11.190 --> 00:09:12.750
It's problem 3 here...

00:09:13.660 --> 00:09:15.230
It's a simultaneous equation.

00:09:15.230 --> 00:09:17.610
Substitute x for this number, and...

00:09:18.350 --> 00:09:19.990
Well then, goodnight.

00:09:20.450 --> 00:09:21.870
Thank you very much.

00:09:23.370 --> 00:09:25.400
Okay, one more shot...

00:09:35.910 --> 00:09:37.330
Guess I should get to bed.

00:09:52.410 --> 00:09:54.540
Sure is a nice morning.

00:10:07.100 --> 00:10:09.250
Huh? That's weird...

00:10:13.200 --> 00:10:15.260
<i>Unusual to not see Hinagiku-san by now.</i>

00:10:15.840 --> 00:10:19.920
<i>It must be because I kept her 
up late to help me study...</i>

00:10:21.480 --> 00:10:23.590
S-So sorry... I'm late...

00:10:24.870 --> 00:10:27.020
Maria-san! What on earth is wrong?

00:10:27.590 --> 00:10:29.080
I've felt dizzy all morning.

00:10:30.190 --> 00:10:31.940
Perhaps I haven't slept enough...

00:10:31.940 --> 00:10:33.590
You've obviously caught a cold!

00:10:33.590 --> 00:10:34.990
Please, go back to bed!

00:10:34.990 --> 00:10:36.410
I-I'm sorry...

00:10:38.610 --> 00:10:40.520
<i>If Maria-san has a cold, then...</i>

00:10:41.050 --> 00:10:41.780
It couldn't be!

00:10:41.990 --> 00:10:44.170
Miss! Are you all right?!

00:10:44.640 --> 00:10:46.540
Hayate...

00:10:46.830 --> 00:10:50.680
My throat, my head, 
and my joints are killing me...

00:10:50.680 --> 00:10:52.250
I was right!

00:10:53.530 --> 00:10:55.650
<i>I can't believe they both got sick...</i>

00:10:56.400 --> 00:10:58.510
<i>Wait! Is it really just them?!</i>

00:10:59.570 --> 00:11:00.550
Hinagiku-san!

00:11:01.360 --> 00:11:02.700
Hinagiku-san!

00:11:09.210 --> 00:11:13.030
Good morning, Hayate-kun. 
Another invigorating morning.

00:11:13.420 --> 00:11:14.650
Go to bed right now!

00:11:15.380 --> 00:11:19.660
I'm fine. 
I can beat a cold with my willpower.

00:11:19.660 --> 00:11:21.520
Just beat it with medicine!

00:11:21.520 --> 00:11:24.350
He's right, Hina. Don't overdo it.

00:11:24.350 --> 00:11:25.200
Chiharu-san!

00:11:33.210 --> 00:11:33.960
Ha...

00:11:33.960 --> 00:11:34.710
...ya...

00:11:34.710 --> 00:11:35.460
...te...

00:11:35.460 --> 00:11:36.210
...ku...

00:11:36.210 --> 00:11:36.960
...n.

00:11:37.700 --> 00:11:38.710
<i>What do I do?</i>

00:11:39.180 --> 00:11:42.090
<i>The apartment has turned 
into a field hospital...</i>

00:11:42.090 --> 00:11:43.220
Good morning!

00:11:43.930 --> 00:11:45.450
Whoa, what happened?

00:11:45.450 --> 00:11:47.970
Nishizawa-san! You're feeling all right?

00:11:47.970 --> 00:11:48.470
Huh?

00:11:49.110 --> 00:11:51.980
Must be nice... 
Idiots don't get sick...

00:11:53.040 --> 00:11:54.980
Cough, cough, cough...

00:11:55.330 --> 00:11:59.400
You too, Nishizawa-san?! 
You were fine until just now!

00:11:59.400 --> 00:12:01.910
No, I'm sick! I really, really am sick!

00:12:01.910 --> 00:12:05.080
I think I'm feverish, 
so I'm going back to bed! Bye!

00:12:07.970 --> 00:12:10.980
So, we'll be taking 
the day off from school.

00:12:10.980 --> 00:12:12.250
Thank you very much.

00:12:13.490 --> 00:12:16.000
You look like you've lost your drive.

00:12:17.340 --> 00:12:19.460
Oh, A-tan, you seem to 
be feeling all right.

00:12:19.460 --> 00:12:20.120
Yes.

00:12:20.510 --> 00:12:23.680
I can't believe everyone 
caught colds all at once.

00:12:24.010 --> 00:12:25.880
You should be careful.

00:12:26.380 --> 00:12:29.670
Hakuo has its very important 
final exams starting tomorrow.

00:12:29.670 --> 00:12:32.810
When everyone else catches a cold 
the day before the exams...

00:12:33.260 --> 00:12:38.070
It ends with you catching a 
cold on exam day and failing!

00:12:38.440 --> 00:12:40.250
Don't jinx me!

00:12:40.250 --> 00:12:42.070
I've studied so hard...

00:12:42.700 --> 00:12:44.520
It is bound to turn out that way.

00:12:44.920 --> 00:12:47.570
Misfortune loves you, after all.

00:12:48.360 --> 00:12:49.580
I can't deny that...

00:12:49.890 --> 00:12:51.460
It's sad, but it's your fate.

00:12:52.890 --> 00:12:54.250
You have a cold too, A-tan?

00:12:54.660 --> 00:12:56.560
I do not have a cold!

00:12:56.560 --> 00:12:59.550
My head and throat are 
just hurting a little.

00:12:59.910 --> 00:13:01.800
That's called a cold!

00:13:02.350 --> 00:13:04.410
Anyway, just stay in bed and rest!

00:13:04.410 --> 00:13:06.390
I'll go buy medicine right now!

00:13:06.390 --> 00:13:07.720
But then you'll end up...

00:13:07.720 --> 00:13:09.300
That doesn't matter!

00:13:11.130 --> 00:13:15.240
I am the butler to Miss Nagi, 
and everyone else in this apartment!

00:13:15.240 --> 00:13:18.860
No matter how it ends for me, 
I will make you all feel better!

00:13:20.090 --> 00:13:23.370
Then buy some doujinshi 
while you're out!

00:13:26.010 --> 00:13:27.690
<b>Hayate Ayasaki</b>

00:13:26.010 --> 00:13:27.690
<b>Occupation: Butler</b>

00:13:31.430 --> 00:13:33.950
<b>Talent:</b>

00:13:31.970 --> 00:13:33.950
<b>Misfortune</b>

00:13:33.950 --> 00:13:36.710
<b>Commercial Connecting Theater</b>

00:13:34.450 --> 00:13:36.080
Commercial Connecting Theater!

00:13:37.080 --> 00:13:39.220
Oh, you're playing a game, Hayate-kun?

00:13:39.220 --> 00:13:42.710
Yes, it's a remake of VII 
that supports StreetPass.

00:13:42.960 --> 00:13:45.720
Why are you playing so frantically?

00:13:46.060 --> 00:13:50.330
Why? Because I'm the only one 
Miss Nagi links up with.

00:13:50.330 --> 00:13:52.720
Did you get the new 
stone tablet yet, Hayate?!

00:13:53.630 --> 00:13:55.520
That sounds rough.

00:13:55.520 --> 00:13:56.500
It is rough.

00:13:56.940 --> 00:13:59.900
<b>Commercial Connecting Theater</b>

00:13:57.720 --> 00:13:59.900
Commercial Connecting Theater!

00:14:00.290 --> 00:14:02.580
Come on, making me wear this...

00:14:02.580 --> 00:14:03.780
Sorry, sorry.

00:14:04.180 --> 00:14:06.400
Where did you get this outfit, anyway?

00:14:06.810 --> 00:14:08.530
It's one of Maria's regular outfits.

00:14:10.180 --> 00:14:12.790
It is not and you know it!

00:14:13.920 --> 00:14:15.420
<i>Time for the final exams.</i>

00:14:15.950 --> 00:14:17.690
<i>My goal is to not get a failing grade.</i>

00:14:17.690 --> 00:14:19.690
<i>This is the time to show 
the fruits of my hard work.</i>

00:14:20.140 --> 00:14:22.210
<i>And on this important day...</i>

00:14:25.080 --> 00:14:27.470
<i>Crap. My head is killing me.</i>

00:14:27.470 --> 00:14:30.100
<i>I'm dizzy... Really dizzy...</i>

00:14:30.100 --> 00:14:32.190
<i>This is totally a cold.</i>

00:14:32.190 --> 00:14:33.950
<i>Just like A-tan said.</i>

00:14:33.950 --> 00:14:37.480
<i>I studied so hard, 
and now it'll all go to waste.</i>

00:14:38.700 --> 00:14:41.280
<i>I'll just have to take 
this medicine and cover it up.</i>

00:14:41.280 --> 00:14:42.510
Good morning.

00:14:43.660 --> 00:14:45.550
G-Good morning!

00:14:45.550 --> 00:14:47.360
Are you feeling better already?

00:14:47.360 --> 00:14:49.470
Yes, thank you.

00:14:49.470 --> 00:14:51.660
But are you all right, Hayate-kun?

00:14:51.860 --> 00:14:52.780
Huh?

00:14:52.780 --> 00:14:56.940
You took care of us all, 
so I was worried you might catch our cold.

00:14:56.940 --> 00:14:58.040
Not a cha—

00:14:59.110 --> 00:15:00.040
U-Um...

00:15:03.320 --> 00:15:04.920
You did catch it?

00:15:05.280 --> 00:15:07.170
I... well...

00:15:07.420 --> 00:15:09.550
You caught my cold?

00:15:09.940 --> 00:15:15.310
You caught a cold on the day 
of final exams because of me?!

00:15:15.310 --> 00:15:16.430
N-Not at all...

00:15:16.710 --> 00:15:20.080
Hakuo kicks people out for 
getting too many failing grades,

00:15:20.080 --> 00:15:22.970
and you caught a cold because of me?!

00:15:26.280 --> 00:15:27.520
<i>A butler...</i>

00:15:27.520 --> 00:15:32.050
<i>No, a man has to hold on 
to his pride sometimes!</i>

00:15:33.010 --> 00:15:36.700
What are you talking about? 
I could never catch a cold!

00:15:36.700 --> 00:15:39.570
Really?! That's my Hayate!

00:15:39.570 --> 00:15:41.050
W-Well, of course!

00:15:41.050 --> 00:15:43.510
I can knock a cold down
 with one finger!

00:15:43.510 --> 00:15:46.060
Amazing! Amazing! That's my Hayate!

00:15:46.060 --> 00:15:47.410
You better believe it!

00:15:50.260 --> 00:15:52.930
Food tastes much better 
when you're healthy, huh?

00:15:52.930 --> 00:15:55.600
Yeah! It's all thanks to Hayate-kun!

00:15:55.840 --> 00:15:57.720
I'm glad everyone's feeling better.

00:15:58.140 --> 00:16:00.680
It really is important to 
have a butler in your life.

00:16:00.680 --> 00:16:01.790
Hayate, tea, please!

00:16:01.790 --> 00:16:03.480
Yes, right away.

00:16:09.900 --> 00:16:11.710
<i>My legs weigh a ton.</i>

00:16:15.210 --> 00:16:17.080
Good morning, Hayate-kun and Nagi.

00:16:17.280 --> 00:16:18.870
Oh, Ruka-san...

00:16:18.870 --> 00:16:20.330
What are you doing here?

00:16:20.650 --> 00:16:22.740
The DVD of my Las Vegas concert is done,

00:16:22.740 --> 00:16:24.080
so I wanted to give you copies.

00:16:24.690 --> 00:16:28.620
Hayate-kun, you don't look so good. 
Want a ride to school?

00:16:28.620 --> 00:16:30.050
Oh, no, I'm fine.

00:16:30.230 --> 00:16:31.190
What's that?!

00:16:31.190 --> 00:16:33.710
Are you trying to say 
Hayate has a cold?!

00:16:33.710 --> 00:16:35.970
Don't lump him in with all 
those other weaklings!

00:16:35.970 --> 00:16:37.550
You better believe it!

00:16:38.500 --> 00:16:40.600
I see. Well, later, then.

00:16:46.070 --> 00:16:47.110
See you later, Hayate.

00:16:47.480 --> 00:16:50.270
My exam is in a different classroom,
 so this is my stop.

00:16:50.270 --> 00:16:52.110
Okay. Take care.

00:16:54.980 --> 00:16:56.860
<i>This situation sucks.</i>

00:16:56.860 --> 00:16:58.610
<i>I'm cold, my joints ache,</i>

00:16:58.610 --> 00:17:02.220
<i>and I'd say I have a fever 
of at least 100 degrees.</i>

00:17:02.610 --> 00:17:05.690
<i>I've got to save enough strength 
to not get a failing grade...</i>

00:17:05.690 --> 00:17:06.630
Hayate-kun!

00:17:08.150 --> 00:17:10.410
Huh? Did I push that hard?

00:17:10.410 --> 00:17:11.550
N-No...

00:17:12.030 --> 00:17:13.940
Are you not feeling well?

00:17:13.940 --> 00:17:16.720
I'm totally fine! I'm always feeling well!

00:17:17.070 --> 00:17:18.420
Thank goodness.

00:17:18.420 --> 00:17:20.690
I thought I'd given you my cold.

00:17:20.690 --> 00:17:22.140
No! You needn't worry!

00:17:22.600 --> 00:17:23.610
Good luck.

00:17:23.960 --> 00:17:27.480
I helped you study, 
so you'd better do well.

00:17:27.780 --> 00:17:29.230
O-Of course!

00:17:30.120 --> 00:17:32.230
I won't forgive you if you fail, okay?

00:17:32.970 --> 00:17:34.220
R-Right...

00:17:38.880 --> 00:17:41.020
The exam starts at 9:30...

00:17:41.020 --> 00:17:44.190
I should get to class early 
and save my strength.

00:17:44.190 --> 00:17:44.760
Ow!

00:17:45.380 --> 00:17:46.580
Ow, ow, ow! Ow, ow, ow!

00:17:46.580 --> 00:17:47.870
Sharna-chan!

00:17:47.870 --> 00:17:51.470
I ate a daifuku someone had left 
as an offering to Ksitigarbha,

00:17:51.470 --> 00:17:54.410
and now my stomach... 
my stomach just started to hurt!

00:17:54.410 --> 00:17:56.800
Ow, ow, ow! Ow, ow, ow!

00:17:54.410 --> 00:17:56.800
That's called a punishment, Fumi-chan.

00:17:56.800 --> 00:17:58.050
Ow! Ow! Ow!

00:17:58.510 --> 00:18:00.900
Someone's going to have to 
carry me to the infirmary at

00:18:00.900 --> 00:18:05.050
the opposite side of the school building,
 about one kilometer away!

00:18:05.050 --> 00:18:07.020
Someone carry me!

00:18:07.380 --> 00:18:09.310
Hey! Did you see that, Sharna-chan?!

00:18:09.540 --> 00:18:11.740
He just pretended not to see me!

00:18:11.740 --> 00:18:14.820
Inhumane! It's inhumane to 
ignore someone who's weak!

00:18:15.120 --> 00:18:17.780
Ow, ow, ow! Ow, ow, ow!

00:18:15.120 --> 00:18:17.780
Oh, fine! I just have to take you there, right?!

00:18:17.780 --> 00:18:21.780
He's being condescending! 
He's being condescending, Sharna-chan!

00:18:21.780 --> 00:18:23.040
<b>Infirmary</b>

00:18:23.590 --> 00:18:27.000
<i>Not only did that waste a ton of energy,
 it wasted a ton of time!</i>

00:18:27.310 --> 00:18:29.360
<i>Even if I run straight to 
the classroom from here,</i>

00:18:29.360 --> 00:18:31.960
<i>I don't even know if I'll make 
it through the exam now...</i>

00:18:33.700 --> 00:18:34.610
<i>Who's calling me now?</i>

00:18:36.440 --> 00:18:37.420
Hayate-sama...

00:18:37.680 --> 00:18:38.300
Yes?

00:18:38.300 --> 00:18:41.500
Is the young master's 
new shop going to be okay?

00:18:42.470 --> 00:18:43.790
What's going on?

00:18:43.790 --> 00:18:47.430
He's been collecting 
new funds to boost profits,

00:18:47.430 --> 00:18:51.270
but he needs a business proposal 
in order to get a loan.

00:18:51.970 --> 00:18:52.940
Oh...

00:18:52.940 --> 00:18:57.030
I don't know anything about 
doujinshi and the like...

00:18:57.030 --> 00:18:59.580
So, I'll read the paperwork 
he wrote to you.

00:18:59.580 --> 00:19:01.220
Would you think it over with me?

00:19:00.550 --> 00:19:03.830
Um, do we have to do that right now?

00:19:03.830 --> 00:19:05.950
Are you busy with something?

00:19:05.950 --> 00:19:06.950
Well, sort of...

00:19:07.760 --> 00:19:08.950
I understand.

00:19:09.710 --> 00:19:11.310
If things don't go well

00:19:11.310 --> 00:19:14.480
because Hayate-sama the work 
expert wouldn't listen,

00:19:14.480 --> 00:19:15.990
and both the young master

00:19:15.990 --> 00:19:18.470
and I die in some freezing 
northern country,

00:19:18.470 --> 00:19:20.240
I suppose it can't be helped...

00:19:18.730 --> 00:19:22.300
Oh, fine! Just five minutes!

00:19:25.360 --> 00:19:27.600
A terrible monster has appeared!

00:19:28.000 --> 00:19:28.600
What?

00:19:28.600 --> 00:19:32.150
A huge monster appeared about 
two kilometers up ahead,

00:19:32.150 --> 00:19:33.480
and it's trying to swallow up the world!

00:19:33.480 --> 00:19:34.230
Right, right.

00:19:34.520 --> 00:19:38.860
And to defeat it, we basically need 
1000cc of Hayate-sama's blood...

00:19:38.860 --> 00:19:39.610
Yep, yep.

00:19:39.990 --> 00:19:43.240
You have to go there right 
now and do something!

00:19:43.540 --> 00:19:44.960
So there you go. Take care of it.

00:19:44.960 --> 00:19:46.990
I just have to go there, right?

00:19:49.500 --> 00:19:52.250
<b>Math II 
English 
Classical Lit.</b>

00:19:49.880 --> 00:19:52.250
Okay, you may begin.

00:19:52.560 --> 00:19:55.250
Katsura-chan, 
Hayata-kun isn't here yet.

00:19:55.530 --> 00:19:58.290
Then, since he's late, 
Ayasaki-kun gets a zero—

00:19:58.290 --> 00:19:59.260
Sorry I'm late.

00:20:00.000 --> 00:20:01.860
You're late, Ayasaki—

00:20:01.860 --> 00:20:03.010
What happened to you?!

00:20:03.310 --> 00:20:05.550
Nothing. I was just late.

00:20:05.550 --> 00:20:07.380
W-Well then, take your seat.

00:20:07.380 --> 00:20:08.310
Right.

00:20:10.160 --> 00:20:13.820
<i>Just relax. 
My hit points aren't down to zero yet.</i>

00:20:13.820 --> 00:20:16.020
<i>If I give up, it's game over.</i>

00:20:23.910 --> 00:20:27.420
I'm so bored during exams...

00:20:27.420 --> 00:20:29.450
<i>Focus. Focus.</i>

00:20:39.040 --> 00:20:40.560
<i>I have to focus.</i>

00:20:44.420 --> 00:20:45.900
Softly...

00:20:46.470 --> 00:20:47.510
<i>Focus!</i>

00:20:56.070 --> 00:20:58.860
Run! Run! Run!

00:21:11.630 --> 00:21:13.210
That's...

00:21:13.820 --> 00:21:15.710
I'm back.

00:21:17.900 --> 00:21:20.310
<i>I managed to get through the test,</i>

00:21:20.310 --> 00:21:22.510
<i>but I've hit every limit I have.</i>

00:21:23.050 --> 00:21:25.440
<i>But now I have to prepare dinner...</i>

00:21:26.910 --> 00:21:28.470
Welcome home!

00:21:30.490 --> 00:21:32.680
U-Um, what is...

00:21:32.680 --> 00:21:34.560
We were getting tired 
of waiting, Hayate!

00:21:34.960 --> 00:21:37.690
We all made dinner to 
thank you for taking care of us.

00:21:37.690 --> 00:21:39.190
Just for today.

00:21:39.430 --> 00:21:41.750
Happy, aren't you? Be happy, Hayate!

00:21:41.750 --> 00:21:43.890
All Nagi did was sneak bites.

00:21:44.190 --> 00:21:45.200
I was taste testing!

00:21:45.600 --> 00:21:47.940
I made the salad!

00:21:47.940 --> 00:21:50.200
The fried chicken is awesome.

00:21:51.190 --> 00:21:52.200
Everyone...

00:21:52.560 --> 00:21:53.950
How nice for you.

00:21:54.580 --> 00:21:56.140
Thank you so much.

00:21:56.140 --> 00:21:58.380
Okay, go wash your hands.

00:21:58.380 --> 00:21:59.460
Sure.

00:22:02.630 --> 00:22:04.300
You had a long day, Hayate-kun.

00:22:05.170 --> 00:22:07.180
I'm sort of sorry
 they took the trouble...

00:22:09.340 --> 00:22:10.260
What's this?

00:22:11.120 --> 00:22:13.430
You scratch our back, we scratch yours.

00:22:14.500 --> 00:22:15.980
Thank you.

00:22:15.980 --> 00:22:17.810
Hey, we're out of soy sauce!

00:22:17.810 --> 00:22:19.300
I'll go buy some right away!

00:22:22.830 --> 00:22:24.860
Pick up Sunday while you're out!

00:22:29.670 --> 00:22:31.310
I bought soy sauce.

00:24:05.750 --> 00:24:07.130
Next time, it's Miss Nagi's turn.

00:24:07.130 --> 00:24:08.440
Give me your hand, Hayate.

00:24:08.440 --> 00:24:08.860
What?

00:24:08.860 --> 00:24:10.290
Don't you know what a Cutie Touch is?

00:24:10.290 --> 00:24:12.400
You do a high five along with a cheer!

00:24:12.400 --> 00:24:13.370
What is that?

00:24:13.370 --> 00:24:14.850
Shout it out, Hayate! Nice Cutie!

00:24:14.850 --> 00:24:15.680
Nice Cutie!

00:24:15.680 --> 00:24:17.810
Cutie Maker! Hey!

00:24:17.050 --> 00:24:17.810
Hey!

00:24:17.810 --> 00:24:19.310
What does that mean?
